//shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727480/extras/a74bab446d620754bd03ea517034c933.webm?t=1784546687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727480/extras/a74bab446d620754bd03ea517034c933.mp4?t=1784546687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🃏 Movement card system: plan each crab’s steps with simple, intuitive mechanics<br>🌍 Environmental manipulation: reshape levels to create new paths and solutions <br>🦀 Dozens of handcrafted puzzles: each one a small, relaxing challenge<br>🧠 No pressure: undo freely, experiment, and enjoy at your own pace <br>🎵 Gentle music and soft visuals: for a cozy, meditative mood</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why You’ll Love It?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy puzzle games that are calm but clever, this one’s for you. <br>There’s something satisfying about watching a tiny crab disappear into a glowing portal,  especially knowing you paved the way.</p>", "short_description": "A calm and relaxing puzzle game where you use movement cards and interact with the environment to guide lost baby crabs safely back to their home, solving increasingly challenging, thoughtfully designed puzzles!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727480/ca8678dc62206f2cb980b3005339f5dd572e3f54/header.jpg?t=1784546687", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727480/7b133e8cd1800b5282b44ebb1a0887fe7727a0fd/capsule_231x87.jpg